/T (Toggle Welcome to Toggle, an exciting and intellectually stimulating self-debating event! This event will test your ability to argue both sides of a motion and showcase your quick thinking, adaptability, and debate skills. In Toggle, each participant will debate against themselves, moving between two positions on the same topic as the moderator calls for a spontaneous "TOGGLE". In this high-energy, single-person event, you will be tasked with arguing both for and against a motion, switching sides in real-time, all while maintaining coherence and clarity in your arguments. Only those who can toggle seamlessly between opposing views will emerge victorious. Event Overview:)
/E (Toggle Welcome to Toggle, an exciting and intellectually stimulating self-debating event! This event will test your ability to argue both sides of a motion and showcase your quick thinking, adaptability, and debate skills. In Toggle, each participant will debate against themselves, moving between two positions on the same topic as the moderator calls for a spontaneous "TOGGLE". In this high-energy, single-person event, you will be tasked with arguing both for and against a motion, switching sides in real-time, all while maintaining coherence and clarity in your arguments. Only those who can toggle seamlessly between opposing views will emerge victorious. Event Overview:)
